      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the tip. i tried bumping it to 220c and the colors got a bit stronger but the blurring at the edges is actually getting worse. we also noticed that sometimes the ink just seems to... disappear or fade in certain spots even when the heat is totally even. it's like the pigment isn't staying where it's supposed to during the press. everything else in the factory seems fine, so it's just this specific transfer issue. any other technical reasons why the ink might not be sticking or might be migrating?",
